  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a medium bowl, whisk together almond flour, coconut sugar, rice flour, salt, and ground cardamom.",
    "Add the melted butter and rosewater to the dry ingredients and mix until well combined.",
    "Gently fold in the blueberries.",
    "Pour the batter into a greased 8-inch round baking dish.",
    "Bake for 35 minutes or until golden brown.",
    "Remove from the oven and let cool for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve warm or at room temperature."
